/**
 * Note: a margin note in article bodies (the mono "§3.1 / policy v4.2" markers that sit in the
 * left column on wide screens and above the paragraph on narrow ones). Must be a direct child of
 * .body, immediately before the paragraph it annotates. In MDX: <Note>**§3.1** / policy v4.2</Note>
 */
---
<p class="note"><slot /></p>
